OL,3,GNEWSAAll you need to know about
OL,4,ACoventry's new protection order
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new Public Spaces Protection Order is
OL,7,Fdue to come into force in Coventry this
OL,8,FSaturday.
OL,10,FBut what is a PSPO and what difference
OL,11,Fwill it make to the city centre?
OL,13,FPublic Spaces Protection Orders (PSPO)
OL,14,Fwere first introduced in 2014 as a way
OL,15,Fto tackle antisocial behaviour.
OL,17,FThey focus on a specific public area
OL,18,Fand are time-limited.
